1
00:00:00,889 --> 00:00:01,889
(Penny:)on a cheap monkey movie

2
00:00:02,056 --> 00:00:04,556
(Penny:)all because some dumb girl
thought it was beneath her.

3
00:00:06,561 --> 00:00:08,541
(Leonard:)At least they talked
about you on Letterman.

4
00:00:11,399 --> 00:00:13,469
(Leonard:)Come on, I can drive you
wherever you need to go.

5
00:00:13,635 --> 00:00:16,085
(Penny:)How?
Unlike me, you have a job.

6
00:00:16,571 --> 00:00:18,741
(Penny:)I'm just gonna have to go back
to being a waitress.

7
00:00:18,907 --> 00:00:21,047
(Penny:)Like I will be
for the rest of my life.

8
00:00:21,843 --> 00:00:24,013
(Sheldon:)Leonard, would you wrap it up?
We're waiting on you.

9
00:00:24,746 --> 00:00:26,586
(Penny:)I'm sorry, is the fact
that my life's falling apart

10
00:00:26,748 --> 00:00:28,698
(Penny:)interfering with your board game?

11
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,760
(Sheldon:)It is.

12
00:00:33,755 --> 00:00:36,665
(Sheldon:)You were wrong, friend Howard.
She completely understood.

13
00:00:41,196 --> 00:00:42,336
(Raj:)Hey, you busy?

14
00:00:42,497 --> 00:00:43,597
(Amy:)No. What's up?

15
00:00:43,765 --> 00:00:45,715
(Raj:)Have you heard back from Emily?

16
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:46,867
(Sheldon:)I have.

17
00:00:47,035 --> 00:00:48,575
Great! And?

18
00:00:48,736 --> 00:00:51,736
(Amy:)And I'm afraid she doesn't think
you're right for her.

19
00:00:53,875 --> 00:00:56,755
(Raj:)I give you one simple thing to do.

20
00:00:56,911 --> 00:00:59,521
(Raj:)Contact a complete stranger and
make her fall in love with me,

21
00:00:59,681 --> 00:01:02,021
and you blow it!

